From 46b5e63c54abe4dfa2090ee81bca67909d26f3e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 08:40:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gi): styled talent texts, Anastasya burst Stellar rows

Texts of imported custom characters use GO's text markup: element words
("AoE Cryo DMG", "Electro RES") get their color, **text** is bold, and
[[text|Term]] is bold and underlined with a tooltip showing the term
from the character's new glossary ([[text|@id]] shows a GO tooltip).

Anastasya and Danica's skill, burst, passive and constellation texts use
it, with glossaries for Transcendence and Blessings, Sealing, Freeze,
Palestar Edict: Triumph/Doom, Excitement, Entry/On-Field Skill E2 and
the Maid states, plus GO's Radiance: Stellar Glimmer, Polestar Field
and Elevation tooltips.

Anastasya's burst gets Stellar-Conduct/Stellar Swirl values for To the
New World's instantaneous DMG and Doom's 1-Hit Cryo DMG, with the same
multipliers. Talent DMG values are listed before durations and costs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Asb8vZRqeTYT9zLpVizGNv
